WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.069
-I'll be asking both of you
animal trivia questions.

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.737
If you answer them correctly,
you will win

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.906
