00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.409
If you answer incorrectly,

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:11.577
your opponent will receive
the puppy.

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:16.315
Most puppies at the end of the
game is the Pup Quiz champion.

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:21.454
♪♪

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:25.925
Tracy, you're our guest,
so we shall commence with you.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:28.728
The first question is...

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:38.104
Is it, "A," green anaconda;

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.273
"B," king cobra,

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:44.176
