-He got "longest snake"!

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:22.415
-"A," the singing bushlark.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:23.583
-That sounds fake.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:26.586
-"B," painted berrypecker.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:29.422
I didn't know Barry was
into that. Or "C" --

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:32.391
-That's the longest species
of snake, by the way.

00:01:32.391 --> 00:01:34.393
[ Laughter ]
-You ever met Barry before?

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:36.395
-Never.

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:38.398
Buff-rumped warbler.

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:41.301
So, is it "A," "B," or "C"?

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:43.803
Singing bushlark...
-Alright, buff-rumped war--

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:45.438
Well, it couldn't be
"C" and "C."

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:46.939
That's the way I did my SATs.

00:01:46.939 --> 00:01:49.108
I would just switch
to different things.

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:51.944
-And how'd you do on those?
-I got a...

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:54.947
610.
So, that's pretty good.

00:01:54.947 --> 00:01:57.851
I'm gonna say, uh...

00:01:57.851 --> 00:01:59.852
Gosh.

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:02.321
S--

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:04.323
Singing bushlark, "A."

00:02:04.323 --> 00:02:07.660
-"A"? Ooh, no.
[ Buzzer sounds ]

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:11.164
It was painted berrypecker.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:12.631
-You're the worst, man.

00:02:12.631 --> 00:02:16.635
-So, Jimmy, Tracy gets our
adorable puppy, Mary Kennedy.

00:02:16.635 --> 00:02:19.304
-Aww! Mary Kennedy!

00:02:19.304 --> 00:02:22.976
[ Dog barking, applause ]

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:25.144
-Yes.

00:02:25.144 --> 00:02:28.313
-The score is 2 pups to 0.
[ Dog barking ]

00:02:28.313 --> 00:02:31.150
Oh! That sounds means it's time
for Double Puppardy.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.652
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:35.021
-Questions are now worth
two puppies.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.155
-Yes!

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:37.490
-And the next question
is for you, Tracy.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.292
