00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:52.338
"A," chinchilla;

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:54.407
"B," a goat;

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:56.742
or "C," sheep.

00:02:56.742 --> 00:02:59.244
-What kind of hair?
-Mohair.

00:02:59.244 --> 00:03:01.380
-Mohair?
-Mm-hmm.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:03.049
[ Clock ticking ]

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:05.885
"A," chinchilla; "B", goat;

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:07.219
or "C," sheep?

00:03:07.219 --> 00:03:09.222
