00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.224
-I'm gonna go "B."

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:13.726
-"B," goat. You are correct!
[ Bell dings ]

00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:15.395
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:18.731
