starting now.

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:13.245
[ Clock ticking ]
Average porcupine.

00:05:13.245 --> 00:05:16.282
Not a super quilly porcupine.
Average.

00:05:16.282 --> 00:05:20.953
Not a bald porcupine.
Regular, everyday --

00:05:20.953 --> 00:05:22.855
[ Buzzer sounds ]
Oh! Alrighty.

00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:24.690
Jimmy, what did you write down?

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.525
