the question, how many quills?

00:05:30.929 --> 00:05:34.032
-2 mill.
-2 mill!

00:05:34.032 --> 00:05:35.901
The answer is 30,000.

00:05:35.901 --> 00:05:38.738
Jimmy, you are
the Pup Quiz winner!

00:05:38.738 --> 00:05:40.572
[ Cheers and applause ]
-I can't take it.

00:05:40.572 --> 00:05:43.142
I can't take it.
